[2026-01-30T00:12:37.091Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01DPW8pT11RcFWywSJDFxcuM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've completed the Feature Scout idea generation for the Report Interactive Features context.\n\n**Summary: Feature Scout Ideas for Report Interactive Features Context**\n\nCreated 5 feature ideas for the Report Interactive Features context (ctx_1769727794240_18jelhg):\n\n1. **Text-to-Speech Audio Playback for Reports** - Like Pocket/Medium, add TTS with playback controls, speed adjustment, and voice selection. Extends the SpeedReader pattern to audio consumption.\n\n2. **Inline Annotations and Highlighting System** - Like Kindle/Hypothesis/Notion, add persistent highlights with color-coding, notes, and aggregated sidebar. Builds on SpotlightText interaction patterns.\n\n3. **Reading Progress Tracking with Bookmarks** - Like Kindle/Pocket, track reading position, percentage complete, estimated time, and bookmarks. Extends IntelDashboard metrics to consumption tracking.\n\n4. **Smart Summary Generation at Multiple Depths** - Like Blinkist, offer 1-sentence, 1-paragraph, and full executive summaries. Enhances KeyPointsPanel with depth control.\n\n5. **Keyboard-First Navigation with Command Palette** - Like VS Code/Linear/Raycast, add Cmd+K command palette and full keyboard navigation. Extends SpeedReader's existing keyboard controls.\n\n**Observations about the Report Interactive Features codebase:**\n- Well-implemented reading enhancement tools (FocusMode, SpeedReader, IntelDashboard, KeyPointsPanel)\n- Strong foundation with SpotlightText for sentence-level interaction and highlighting\n- SpeedReader has sophisticated RSVP with focal point calculation and WPM control\n- Good keyboard support in SpeedReader (space, arrows, escape) - can be expanded\n- IntelDashboard provides rich metrics visualization with AnimatedProgressRing and trend indicators\n- KeyPointsPanel has filtering, expansion, and highlighting - ready for annotation features\n- Theme-aware (radar/swiss) implementation throughout"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3761,"cache_read_input_tokens":117825,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3761},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05d3e4f1-2259-4f3e-a055-8040a34c8b02","uuid":"6559a8f3-90fe-45af-8a1a-c467cdae9d7a"}
